# Excel function catalog. NAME|min_args|max_args(-1=variadic)|signature|summary|first version
# version: blank = available in Excel 2003 (.xls); 2007/2010/2013/2016/2019/2021/365 = introduced then.
# ---- logical
AND|1|-1|logical1, ...|TRUE if all arguments are TRUE|
BYCOL|2|2|array, lambda|Apply a LAMBDA to each column|365
BYROW|2|2|array, lambda|Apply a LAMBDA to each row|365
FALSE|0|0||Logical FALSE|
IF|2|3|logical_test, value_if_true, [value_if_false]|Choose by condition|
IFERROR|2|2|value, value_if_error|Fallback when value is an error|2007
IFNA|2|2|value, value_if_na|Fallback when value is #N/A|2013
IFS|2|-1|test1, value1, ...|First value whose test is TRUE|2019
ISOMITTED|1|1|argument|TRUE if a LAMBDA argument is missing|365
LAMBDA|1|-1|parameter1, ..., calculation|Define a reusable function|365
LET|3|-1|name1, value1, ..., calculation|Name intermediate results|2021
MAKEARRAY|3|3|rows, cols, lambda|Build an array from a LAMBDA|365
MAP|2|-1|array1, ..., lambda|Map a LAMBDA over arrays|365
NOT|1|1|logical|Logical negation|
OR|1|-1|logical1, ...|TRUE if any argument is TRUE|
REDUCE|3|3|initial_value, array, lambda|Fold an array with a LAMBDA|365
SCAN|3|3|initial_value, array, lambda|Running fold with a LAMBDA|365
SWITCH|3|-1|expression, value1, result1, ..., [default]|Match a value against cases|2019
TRUE|0|0||Logical TRUE|
XOR|1|-1|logical1, ...|Exclusive OR|2013
